#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Runs the checks that decide the gateways: the separation guard and the three direction checks, the self-contained rehearsal, the seed-readiness table at seed time, and the gates of the new repository from a fresh clone. A check that could not run stops the process; it is never read as a pass."
msgstr ""

